    title: 'Politics in Esquire',
    desc: `Controversial features on ${L('https://www.esquiremag.ph/long-reads/esqa/salvador-panelo-a1513-a1521-20160919-lfrm3', 'Salvador Panelo')}, ${L('https://www.esquiremag.ph/long-reads/what-ive-learned/richard-gordon-what-i-ve-learned-a00207-20170717-lfrm', 'Dick Gordon')}, and ${L('https://www.esquiremag.ph/long-reads/profiles/mocha-uson-full-text-a1521-20161202-lfrm4', 'Mocha Uson')}, published amid the dawn of online culture wars`,
